You smack your forehead against your enemy's head (or whatever sensitive part you can find), causing [51, 55, 58, 60, 63 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)] Physical damage.

If the attack hits, the target is confused ([25%, 32%, 38%, 42%, 44% (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100)] effect) for [4, 4, 5, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Damage done increases with the quality of your headgear, your Strength, and your physical damage bonuses.

Confusion power increases with your Dexterity, and chance increases with Accuracy.
